<title>SINGAPORE: Orchard Parade forms two new units.</title>
<headline>Orchard Parade forms two new units.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property-based Orchard Parade Holdings Ltd said on Monday it had incorporated two new wholly-owned subsidiaries.</p>
<p>It said in a statement both units -- OPH Electronics Pte Ltd and OPH Investments Holdings Pte Ltd -- were investment holding companies.</p>
<p>The units have an authorised share capital of Singapore $100,000 each.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
